  "Id": "0814a593-80ab-416f-a3ca-eef78b0a9c0c"/*WrapPointPosition*/,
  "Description": "Wraps point positions around a cubic volume, e.g., around the current camera position, so points leaving one side reappear on the opposite side.\n\nF1 is set to fade towards the edges of the volume.\n\nSee also: [WrapPoints]",
